    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Reads the **home standby replica** (`postgres-authority-home-return`, streaming from the Oracle writer), so numbers lag real time by seconds and stay visible while the home app plane is parked. If Oracle fails over, repoint the `PantryPostgres` datasource at the new primary. **Not here on purpose:** Extension requests by route and commands by name have no backing table — they only exist as process-local Prometheus counters in unscraped worker processes, and need the per-role `/metrics` code fix before any dashboard can show them."
      }
    }
  ]
}
